        "applicantEligibilityDesc": "Eligibility Requirements\r\nApplicants for the ODF must meet all the requirements discussed in this NOFO. Failure to meet the eligibility criteria by the application deadline may result in exclusion from consideration or preclude NIFA from making an award. For those new to federal financial assistance, NIFA&rsquo;s About Grants provides highly recommended information about grants and other resources to help understand the federal awards process.\r\n\r\nApplications will only be accepted from organizations, not from individuals. Organizations may include state agricultural experiment stations, colleges and universities, research institutions and organizations, private organizations, foundations or corporations, federal agencies, National laboratories.",
